error[E0435]: a type after 'new' is not parenthesized
 --> $DIR/new-parenthesized-type.nra:6:14
  |
6 | let origin = new (Point)();
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^^ the class cannot be written in parentheses here
  |                  - this '(' begins the arguments of a target-typed 'new'
  |                         - a second argument list follows
  |
  = help: where the type is expected, the class can be left out: 'new(x)'
help: write the class without parentheses
  |
6 | let origin = new Point();
  |                  ~~~~~

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0435`.
